THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The app has one dependency, and the engine it depends on has one more. Keeping
the count that low is deliberate: every addition is a supply chain this project
then owns.

  zhen-core               https://github.com/zhen-swift/zhen-core
                          Copyright 2026 Juan Carlos Estévez Rodríguez
                          Apache License 2.0
                          The engine. Linked as libraries (ZhenCore, ZhenScan,
                          ZhenDarwin, ZhenPrivilege), and its zhen-helper
                          executable is embedded in the app bundle.

  swift-argument-parser   https://github.com/apple/swift-argument-parser
                          Copyright Apple Inc. and the Swift project authors
                          Apache License 2.0
                          Resolved as a dependency of zhen-core's command-line
                          tool. Not linked into the app or the helper.

Nothing else is vendored, bundled or statically linked. The app spawns no
subprocesses and depends on no external binaries at runtime.
